4.1 T REE TRANSDUCTION -> 80
The task is used as a preliminary task to see if the model is able to learn the implicit tree structure on the source side.

(Eisner, 2016) -> 15
See Eisner (2016) for further details (appropriately titled “Inside-Outside and Forward-Backward Algorithms Are Just Backprop”).

(Li & Eisner, 2009) -> 5
